{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"You are not the only person here.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:52:28.783000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869426995010863125","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"The nameless seas Irynx and starts openly weeping. \"I.. I'm sorry..\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:53:07.435000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869427157129101393","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I failed.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:53:12.365000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869427177807052830","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"What did you try to do?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:53:21.841000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869427217552265297","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I saw them, they were with the dragon, locked in its mouth.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:54:07.641000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869427409651367968","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I asked them three questions, but I got no answers in return.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:54:26.037000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869427486809817089","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Irynx grabs Willow's shoulders to steady herself.","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:54:50.413000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869427589050163220","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"He slowly crawls over to Irynx, clutching at her waist desperately. \"I'm sorry, cap. I failed.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:54:58.528000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869427623086932009","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I wanted to be the one to bring them back, so that... You won't have to go to Niflhel.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:55:13.739000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869427686886477864","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Willow stops paying attention to nameless.","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:55:18.176000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869427705496604713","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Irynx, are you alright?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:55:26.992000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869427742473592872","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"So that you won't have to risk yourself again.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:55:27.427000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869427744298139748","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Here, I am not your captain. I am a priestess of Huginn. What did you ask? Tell us everything.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:55:30.385000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869427756704882710","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"The thought of other responsibilities sobered the Speaker, he wipes his eyes and calms himself down.","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:56:15.426000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869427945620512808","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I asked for why they did what they did. They said if Apgan wasn't returned to normal the Gods of the Old World would come to bring cataclysm to our shores.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:56:57.523000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869428122188144660","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"They said that the Noir would've brought us all down with one blow.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:57:23.731000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869428232112451648","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"So you did get answers.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:57:54.597000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869428361573855282","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"And that the way to overcome what comes next is to get stronger.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:58:08.989000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869428421938262036","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Yeah. Answers that don't mean anything.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:58:17.435000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869428457363365898","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"All answers mean something. The ravens wouldn't waste a word.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:58:51.538000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869428600401715251","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"When I died, you know what they told me?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:59:35.072000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869428782996549652","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Also one thing...\" The nameless hesitates and then shakes his head. \"Yeah no, that's all.\"\n\"What?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T03:59:43.206000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869428817112997940","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"*Strength comes from knowing your friends.* What do you think they mean now, when they said to 'get stronger'?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:00:23.727000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-27T04:01:51.861000Z","id":"869428987070386187","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"What else did they say?\" Willow says with a stern face.","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:00:34.235000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869429031144153169","reply_to_id":"869428817112997940","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"That's all they said.\" The nameless responds to Willow, completely honest.","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:01:09.119000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869429177458249778","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"You are not meant to bring them back on your own, Speaker. Strength is friends, allies. I keep telling you, you are not the only person standing in the front.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:01:33.387000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869429279245611018","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"You said 'also one thing.' What else happened?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:01:47.136000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-27T04:01:53.474000Z","id":"869429336913100870","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Nothing concerning the ravens.\" The nameless replies, quickly shutting down the topic.","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:02:10.859000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869429436414586890","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"He turns to Irynx. \"If you go to Niflhel, you might die. And not come back.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:02:32.625000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869429527707799663","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Will you keep what you know from us?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:02:33.457000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-27T04:02:39.827000Z","id":"869429531197464646","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I was just hoping to not let that happen. Selfish I know, but that's one thing I can never accept.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:03:06.125000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869429668216983562","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Then you are weak.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:03:36.496000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869429795602182155","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Yes I am.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:03:45.026000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869429831379595274","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"And to overcome what comes next requires strength. Strength you refuse to have.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:04:50.756000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869430107071217695","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"The nameless turns silent at this.","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:05:41.982000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869430321928622080","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Willow mutters *The ravens chose the wrong speaker.*","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:06:05.558000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869430420813525033","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"We will go to Niflhel no matter what, Speaker. Whether or not we know what you won't tell us.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:07:17.127000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869430720995672117","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Something inside the nameless snaps. If no one wanted his help then fine. The ravens talk of wanting to save themselves, then refuse to help. Irynx talks of friendship but leaves him.","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:07:53.457000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869430873374720070","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Fine then.\" He hisses out. \"If you want to go die so bad, be my guest.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:08:10.098000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869430943172141076","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"The dragon Nidhoggur is most likely what lies at the end of your journey.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T04:08:26.950000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869431013854568449","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
